          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Highly visible public diplomatic confrontations and accusations between the US and China spur domestic legislators and regulators to open hearings and propose oversight measures targeting foreign‑linked AI capabilities, raising scrutiny intensity." />
