          <attvalue for="35" value="0.55" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="More public and antagonistic US–China diplomatic signaling prompts China to deepen energy purchases from Russia as both a supply-security move and political signal, raising the volume of Russian oil exports directed to Asian markets." />
