          <attvalue for="35" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Escalatory public signaling between Washington and Beijing prompts US policymakers to increase formal and back‑channel diplomatic contacts with Iran and Gulf partners to deconflict risks to energy flows and reassure regional actors." />
