          <attvalue for="29" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.9" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A sudden increase in legislative and oversight actions on AI (export controls, licensing, approvals) directly raises unpredictability about cross-border rules and compliance burdens for US–China technology exchanges, increasing regulatory uncertainty for actors in the bilateral relationship." />
